# Copy to .env (git-ignored) or export in your shell. Never commit a real key.
#
# Optional. Only needed for field data (`inp field`, and the field part of `inp analyse`).
# A Google Cloud API key whose project has BOTH APIs enabled:
#   - Chrome UX Report API   https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/chromeuxreport.googleapis.com
#   - PageSpeed Insights API https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/pagespeedonline.googleapis.com
# Create the key at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Without it, run lab-only with `inp analyse <url> --no-field`.
INP_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
